hadiths[41]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1197","[AI-translation] Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas aadmi bhej kar poocha: Kya aadmi apni biwi se haiz ki haalat mein mubashirat kar sakta hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Woh apne neeche tehband kas kar bandhe phir chahe to mubashirat kare."
"1198","[AI-translation] Amr bin Uhaihah bin Jalah ya Amr bin Falan bin Uhaihah bin Jalah se, Khuzaimah bin Sabit se riwayat hai, Shafi'i ne farmaya: Mujhe shak hua, ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aurton ke peeche se aane ya aadmi ke apni biwi ke peeche aane ke bare mein poocha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Halal hai.' Jab woh aadmi wapas gaya to Aap ne use bulaya ya use bulane ka hukm diya. To farmaya: 'Tum ne kya kaha tha? Kis surakh mein? Kya peeche se is ki aage ki sharmgah mein to han, ya peeche se is ke peeche mein to nahin. Kyunke Allah haq se haya nahin karta. Aurton ke peeche na aao.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Us ne kaha: Tumhara kya khayal hai? Main ne kaha: Mere chacha siqah hain aur Abdullah bin Ali siqah hain. Us ne kaha: Muhammad ne mujhe Ansari muhaddis se khabar di ke us ne is ki khair ke sath tareef ki aur Khuzaimah un mein se hain jin ki siqahat mein koi aalim shak nahin karta, to main is mein rukhsat nahin deta balke is se mana karta hun."
"1199","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Un logon ko kya hai jo apni laundiyon se sohbat karte phir azl karte hain? Mere paas koi laundi na aae jis ka aaqa iqrar kare ke us ne is se sohbat ki hai magar main is ke bachche ko is se mila dunga. Phir is ke baad azl karo ya chhod do."
"1200","[AI-translation] Safiyah bint Abi Ubaid se, Umar se Ibn Shihab ki Salim se hadees ki misl riwayat hai."
"1201","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab ya Abu Salamah se, Sufyan ko shak hua, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bacha bistar wale ka hai aur zani ke liye pathar hai.'"
"1202","[AI-translation] Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Abd bin Zam'ah aur Sa'd ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ke bare mein jhagda kiya. To Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere bhai ne mujhe wasiyat ki thi ke jab main Makkah aaun to Zam'ah ki laundi ke bete ko dekhun phir use le lun, kyunke woh mera beta hai. To Abd bin Zam'ah ne kaha: Mera bhai aur mere baap ki laundi ka beta hai, mere baap ke bistar par paida hua. To Aap ne Utbah se wazeh mushabihat dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aey Abd bin Zam'ah! Woh tumhara hai. Bacha bistar wale ka hai. Aur Aey Saudah! Is se parda karo.'"
"1203","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Yazeed se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar yani Ibn Khattab ne Banu Zuhrah ke ek buzurg ko jo hamare ghar mein rahte the bulane ke liye aadmi bheja. To main bhi is ke sath Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaya. To unhon ne is se zamana jahiliyat ke bachchon ke bare mein poocha. To us ne kaha: Bistar falan ka hai aur nutfa falan ka hai. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Tum ne sach kaha, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bistar ke haq mein faisla diya hai."
"1204","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke dehat ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Meri biwi ne kala bacha jana hai.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tumhare paas oont hain?' Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'In ke rang kya hain?' Us ne kaha: Surkh. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya in mein safed siyah hain?' Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare khayal mein yeh kahan se aaya?' Us ne kaha: Kisi nasab ne use khaincha hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Shayad ise bhi nasab ne khaincha hai.'"
"1205","[AI-translation] Ibn Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Banu Fazarah ka ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Meri biwi ne kala bacha jana hai.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tumhare paas oont hain?' Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'In ke rang kya hain?' Us ne kaha: Surkh hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya in mein safed siyah hain?' Us ne kaha: Han in mein safed siyah hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh in mein kahan se aae?' Us ne kaha: Shayad kisi nasab ne use khaincha hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aur ise bhi shayad nasab ne khaincha hai.'"
"1206","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Meri ek biwi hai jo chhoone wale ka hath nahin rokti.' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use talaq de do.' Us ne kaha: 'Main use chahta hun.' Aap ne farmaya: 'To phir use rok kar rakho.'"
"1207","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah Azza wa Jalla ki masjidon se na roko, aur jab woh niklen to baghair khushbu lagaae niklen.'"
"1208","[AI-translation] Salim se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki bandiyon ko Allah Azza wa Jalla ki masjidon se na roko.'"
"1209","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hindun Umm Mu'awiyah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Abu Sufyan bakheel aadmi hai. Woh mujhe woh nahin deta jo mujhe aur mere bachche ko kafi ho siwae is ke jo main is se chhup kar leti hun jabke woh nahin janta. To kya is mein mujh par kuch hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo tumhen aur tumhare bachche ko kafi ho woh maroof ke sath le lo.'"
"1210","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Hindun bint Utbah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Abu Sufyan bakheel aadmi hai aur mere liye is se siwae is ke kuch nahin jo woh mujhe deta hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo tumhen aur tumhare bachche ko kafi ho woh maroof ke sath le lo.'"
"1211","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere paas ek dinar hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne nafs par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne bete par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne ghar walon par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use apne khadim par kharch karo.' Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum zyada jante ho.' Sa'id ne kaha: Phir Abu Hurairah jab yeh hadees bayan karte to kahte: Tumhara beta kahta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe kis ke supurd karte ho? Tumhari biwi kahti hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe talaq do. Tumhara khadim kahta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe bech do."
"1212","[AI-translation] Abu Zinad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin Musayyab se us aadmi ke bare mein poocha jo apni biwi par kharch karne ke liye kuch na pata ho. Unhon ne kaha: In donon ke darmiyan judai kar di jaegi. Abu Zinad ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Sunnat hai? To Sa'id ne kaha: Sunnat hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Sa'id ke qaul ke mushabeh ke sunnat hai, ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat hai."
"1213","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se, Nafi' se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne faujon ke ameeron ko un aadmiyon ke bare mein likha jo apni biwiyon se door gae hue the. Phir unhen hukm diya ke un se kharcha karne ya talaq dene ka mutalba karen. Aur agar woh talaq den to jo kharcha unhon ne roka tha woh bhejen."
"1214","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Munkadir se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mere paas maal aur ayaal hai, aur mere walid ke paas maal aur ayaal hai. Woh mera maal lena chahta hai aur apne ayaal ko khilana chahta hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum aur tumhara maal tumhare walid ke ho.'"
"1215","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Muhammad bin Maslamah ki beti Rafi' bin Khadij ke paas thin. Us ne is se kisi baat ko napasand kiya, ya budhapa ya is ke siwa. Phir us ne use talaq dene ka irada kiya. To us ne kaha: 'Mujhe talaq na do, mujhe rok kar rakho aur mere liye jo chaaho taqseem karo.' To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Aur agar koi aurat apne shauhar se sar-kashi ka khauf rakhe [Nisa: 128], aayat."
"1216","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Mulaikah se riwayat hai, unhon ne use kahte suna: Aqeel bin Abi Talib ne Fatimah bint Utbah se nikah kiya. To us ne un se kaha: Mere liye sabr karo aur main tum par kharch karungi. Aur jab woh is ke paas dakhil hote to woh un se kahti: Utbah aur Shaibah kahan hain? To woh is se khamosh rahte. Ek din woh naraz ho kar dakhil hue. To us ne kaha: Utbah bin Rabi'ah aur Shaibah bin Rabi'ah kahan hain? To unhon ne kaha: Jab tum dakhil hogi to tumhare baen janib jahannam mein. To us ne apne kapde kas liye aur Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aai aur un se is ka zikr kiya. To unhon ne Ibn Abbas aur Mu'awiyah ko bheja. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Main zaroor in donon ke darmiyan judai kar dunga. Aur Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Main Banu Abd Manaf ke do buzurgon ke darmiyan judai nahin karunga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh donon in donon ke paas aae aur unhen paya ke unhon ne apne kapde kas liye the. To un donon ne in donon ke muamle mein sulah kara di."
"1217","[AI-translation] Ubaidah se, Ibn Sirin se riwayat hai ke unhon ne is aayat ke bare mein kaha: Aur agar tumhen in donon ke darmiyan jhagde ka khauf ho to ek munsif is ke ghar walon se aur ek munsif is ke ghar walon se bhejo [Nisa: 35]. Unhon ne kaha: Ek mard aur aurat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae, aur in mein se har ek ke sath logon ki ek jama'at thi. To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen hukm diya aur unhon ne ek munsif is ke ghar walon se aur ek munsif is ke ghar walon se bheja. Phir unhon ne donon munsifon se kaha: Kya tum jante ho tum par kya hai? Agar tum jama karna dekho aur agar tum judai karna dekho. Unhon ne kaha: Aurat ne kaha: Main Allah ki Kitab par raazi hun jo mujh par hai aur jo mere liye hai. Aur mard ne kaha: Judai to nahin. To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ki qasam! Yahan tak ke tum usi ka iqrar karo jis ka us ne iqrar kiya."
"1218","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Muhammad bin Maslamah ki beti Rafi' bin Khadij ke paas thin. Us ne is se kisi baat ko napasand kiya, ya budhapa ya is ke siwa, yahan tak ke us ne use talaq dene ka irada kiya. Phir us ne kaha: 'Mujhe talaq na do jabke main tumhare liye halal hun.' To is ke bare mein nazil hua: Aur agar koi aurat apne shauhar se sar-kashi ya be-rukhi ka khauf rakhe [Nisa: 128], aayat. Unhon ne kaha: Phir is se sunnat jari hui."
"1219","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Abdullah bin Abi Zubab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ki bandiyon ko na maro.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Aap ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aurten apne shauharon par diler ho gai hain. To Aap ne unhen marne ki ijazat di. Phir Aal Muhammad ke paas bahut si aurten aain, sab apne shauharon ki shikayat karti thin. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aal Muhammad ke paas sattar aurten aain, sab apne shauharon ki shikayat karti thin. Tum unhen apne behtareen mein na paoge.'"
"1220","[AI-translation] Hilal bin Abi Maimunah se, Abu Maimunah se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ladke ko is ke baap aur is ki maa ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya."
"1221","[AI-translation] Yunus bin Abdullah Jarmi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ali ne meri maa aur mere chacha ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya. Phir unhon ne mere us bhai se jo mujh se chhota tha kaha: 'Yeh bhi agar is umr tak pahunch jae to main use ikhtiyar dunga.'"
"1222","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Ibrahim ne Yunus se, Umarah se, Ali se isi ki misl riwayat kiya. Aur hadees mein kaha: Main saat ya aath saal ka tha."
"1223","[AI-translation] Abu Yahya se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muli woh hai jo qasam khae ke woh apni biwi ke paas kabhi nahin jaega."
"1224","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke das se zyada Sahaba ko paya, sab muli ko rokte. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Das se zyada se kam az kam tehrah hain. Aur woh kahte hain: Ansar mein se."
"1225","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke das se zyada Sahaba ko paya, sab muli ko rokte."
"1226","[AI-translation] Amr bin Salamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas hazri di, aur unhon ne muli ko roka taake woh ya to talaq de ya ruju' kare."
"1227","[AI-translation] Marwan bin Hakam se, Mujahid se riwayat hai ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne muli ko faisle ke liye roka."
"1228","[AI-translation] Tawus se riwayat hai ke Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) muli ko rok kar is se talaq ya ruju' ke bare mein poochte."
"1229","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se us aadmi ka zikr hota jo qasam khae ke woh apni biwi ke paas nahin jaega, phir use paanch maheene chhod de to woh use kuch na samajhtin yahan tak ke use roka jae. Aur woh kahtin: Allah Ta'ala ne kaise farmaya: Maroof ke sath rokna ya ehsan ke sath chhodna [Baqarah: 229]."
"1230","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Jab aadmi apni biwi se eela kare to is par talaq waqe nahin hoti, agarche chaar maheene guzar jaen, yahan tak ke use roka jae taake woh ya to talaq de ya ruju' kare.'"
"1231","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) muli ko roka karte."
"1232","[AI-translation] Amrah se riwayat hai ke unhen Habibah bint Sahl (Raziyallahu anha) ne khabar di ke woh Sabit bin Qais bin Shamas ke paas thin. Aur jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah ki namaz ke liye nikle to unhon ne Habibah bint Sahl ko andhere mein apne darwaze par paya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dekh kar poocha: 'Yeh kaun hai?' Us ne kaha: 'Main Habibah bint Sahl hun, Ya Rasulullah!' Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kya hua?' Us ne kaha: 'Na main aur na Sabit zauj ke liye.' Phir jab Sabit bin Qais (Raziyallahu anhu) aae to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Yeh Habibah bint Sahl hai, is ne woh zikr kiya jo Allah ne chaha ke woh zikr kare.' Habibah ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Jo us ne mujhe diya tha woh mere paas hai.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sabit se farmaya: 'Is se le lo.' To us ne is se le liya, aur Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) khula hasil karke apne ghar walon ke paas wapas aai."
"1233","[AI-translation] Habibah bint Sahl (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh andhere mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai, aur apne hathon se kisi cheez ki shikayat ki aur kaha: 'Na main aur na Sabit bin Qais guzara kar sakte hain.' Habibah kahti hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sabit se farmaya: 'Aey Sabit! Jo tum ne use diya tha woh wapas le lo.' Us ne wapas le liya, aur woh khula hasil karke baith gai."
"1234","[AI-translation] Nafi' ne Safiyah bint Abi Ubaid ki aazad karda laundi ke bare mein bayan kiya ke us ne apne shauhar se apne tamam maal ke badle mein khula hasil kiya, aur Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne is par etiraz na kiya."
"1235","[AI-translation] Umm Bakrah Aslamiyah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne shauhar Abdullah bin Usaid se khula hasil kiya, phir woh donon is muamle ko Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas lae. Unhon ne farmaya: 'Agar tum ne kuch aur zikr kiya hai to wohi hai jo zikr kiya hai, warna yeh talaq hai.'"
"1236","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai ke Ibn Abbas aur Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhum) ne us aurat ke bare mein kaha jis ne khula hasil kiya aur phir is ke shauhar ne use talaq di: 'Use talaq ki zaroorat nahin, kyunke shauhar ne use talaq di jo ab is ki biwi nahin rahi.'"
"1237","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, Ibn Abbas aur Ibn Zubair (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Iddat mein khula hasil karne wali aurat ko talaq nahin pahunchti, kyunke ab shauhar ne use talaq di hai aur woh ab is ki biwi nahin rahi.'"
